    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18600" root="سأو" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِئَةٌ</span></b>  of a bow, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُؤَةٌ</span></b> , (Ibn-Málik, Az, ISd,
K, TA,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَأَةٌ</span></b> , (Ibn-Málik, K, TA,) [in the
CK erroneously written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ساءَة</span>, and it is there implied that the other vars. are <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِيْئَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُوْءَةٌ</span>,]
dial. vars. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِيَةٌ</span>, (K, &amp;c.,) i. e. The <i>curved
extremity</i> thereof. (TA.) [See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سيو</span>.]

